&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We also embrace our diverse culture and offer a range of Employee Resource Groups (&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.godaddy/culture&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Culture&lt;/a&gt;). Have a side hustle? No problem. We love entrepreneurs! Most importantly, come as you are and make your own way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
