&lt;p&gt;We are hiring a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Delivery Manager &lt;/strong&gt;based in Paris for the EMEA Market. Client Success Manager is a key stakeholder at Horizon Software, she/he acts as a link not only between customers and the company but also between various teams, including Sales, Legal, Account Managers, Product Owners, Product Experts, Client Services and Engineering teams.&lt;/p&gt;
